{"about_the_game":"Gloomfall is an <strong>Open World Dark Fantasy Action RPG with Roguelike elements</strong>, where you take the role of a hero, who <strong>travels through portals</strong> into unique, procedurally-generated worlds and biomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Portal.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>Move through portals into unique procedurally-generated worlds. It's up to you what you're going to do - Loot abandoned houses, defeat enemies, run to the nearest portal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAYSTYLE</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Playstyle.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>Find, buy or craft new equipment, and use it against your enemies! Choose your play style - Two-handed or one-handed warrior with a shield? Sneaky archer? Or maybe a small dagger to surprise your enemies in the darkness? It's up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOSSES</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Boss.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>Try beating bosses to gain experience and pride, if you dare!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EQUIPMENT AND HOUSES</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Building.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>After collecting all those items, sell them to buy new items or even build your own house piece by piece!","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2922510?t=1741114511","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741114511","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/b7d76935d6201039e76b376d41ad0f4e32f9ec1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741114511","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/b7d76935d6201039e76b376d41ad0f4e32f9ec1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741114511","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Gloomfall is an <strong>Open World Dark Fantasy Action RPG with Roguelike elements</strong>, where you take the role of a hero, who <strong>travels through portals</strong> into unique, procedurally-generated worlds and biomes.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EXPLORE</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Portal.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>Move through portals into unique procedurally-generated worlds. It's up to you what you're going to do - Loot abandoned houses, defeat enemies, run to the nearest portal.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">PLAYSTYLE</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Playstyle.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>Find, buy or craft new equipment, and use it against your enemies! Choose your play style - Two-handed or one-handed warrior with a shield? Sneaky archer? Or maybe a small dagger to surprise your enemies in the darkness? It's up to you!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">BOSSES</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Boss.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>Try beating bosses to gain experience and pride, if you dare!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EQUIPMENT AND HOUSES</h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2922510/extras/Building.gif?t=1741114511\" /><br>After collecting all those items, sell them to buy new items or even build your own house piece by piece!","developers":["Emil Kuk"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"head